# CUTLASS CUP: a Super Ball struck with your weapon flies back as a Super
# Ball, faster than it came.
game cutlass
wait 5
cheat match 0 1
cheat cpu 1 0
wait 2
cheat play
cheat pos 0 60 100
cheat superball 1 150 100 -3
wait 18
press B
wait 8
expect caught_by == -1
expect ball_team == 0
expect ball_kind == 1
expect ball_vx100 > 300
expect st0 != 5
